{"id":"m2://rec/open_logic/content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#proof-1#1","source":"open_logic","snapshot":"blake3:a5eb116529d3e799289dd9f7e7530d0d446b3615f5608fe08c668241eee3c765","locator":"https://github.com/OpenLogicProject/OpenLogic/blob/1e960beff9ed7835bf3e3f1335e21af3439cd107/content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#L21","native_id":"content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#proof-1","kind":"proof","text":"\\begin{derivation}\n1. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves (!A \\lif !B) \\lif (\\lnot !B \\lif \\lnot !A)$ & \\PL \\\\\n2. &  $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Box(!A \\lif !B) \\lif (\\Box\\lnot!B \\lif \\Box\\lnot!A)$ & \\RK, 1 \\\\\n3. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves (\\Box\\lnot!B \\lif \\Box\\lnot!A) \\lif (\\lnot\n\\Box\\lnot!A \\lif \\lnot\\Box\\lnot!B)$ & \\Taut\\\\\n4. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Box(!A \\lif !B) \\lif (\\lnot\n\\Box\\lnot!A \\lif \\lnot\\Box\\lnot!B)$ & \\PL, 2, 3 \\\\\n5. &  $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Box(!A \\lif !B) \\lif (\\Diamond!A \\lif \\Diamond!B)$ & $\\Diamond$ for $\\lnot\\Box\\lnot$.\n\\end{derivation}","class":"open","by":"textbook/1","resource":"PKGMM3P5QY","at":{"section":"50.6","kind":"proof"}}
